    I/O, topology recovery, and later schema-2 rolling package gates.
  * Split routine backups from leader-pinned recovery-window captures and add
    strict fresh voter, Raft identity, service-freeze, and digest restore gates.
  * Add verified forced OVN recovery reconciliation with restored-row UUID
    adoption/references, DHCP ownership checks, and a read-only managed-graph
    audit that reports malformed, orphaned, or conflicting rows without pruning.
